      <div type="clause" n="47">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 47</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XLIII} Gif mon men eage ofáslea, geselle him mon LX scill' ⁊ VI scill' ⁊ VI pæningas, ⁊ ðriddan dæl pæninges to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone strikes the eye from a man, he shall be given 60 shillings and 6 shillings and 6 pennies and a third of a penny as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone knocks out a man's eye, he shall give him 66 shillings, 6 pence and the third part of a penny as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XLIII. Gif mon men his eage ofaslea, gesylle him mon LX scll' ⁊ VI scll' ⁊ VI peningas ⁊ ðriddan dæl peniges to bote.</ab>
      </div>
